<h2 id="overview">Overview<a class="header-link" href="#overview" title="Link to this heading"></a></h2>
<p>The <code>.en-toc</code> component provides document navigation with:</p>
<ul>
<li>Sticky positioning that scrolls independently</li>
<li>Optional reading progress bar</li>
<li>Rail variant with active marker</li>
<li>CSS-only active section highlighting (progressive enhancement)</li>
<li>Nested list support for heading hierarchy</li>
</ul>
